# Config
# config.json is auto-generated by the app if missing.
# We CAN include a default template, or ignore it if it contains personal mappings.
# For a public repo, it is common to include a template (e.g. config.sample.json) and ignore config.json.
# But for simplicity here, we'll track config.json as the default.
# config.json - Uncomment to ignore local config
